OL,6,     FFrance v South Africa (Kick-off
OL,7,     F8.10pm). Jill Douglas presents
OL,8,     Fcoverage of both teams' second
OL,9,     Fmatch of the Northern Hemisphere
OL,10,     FSeries, and penultimate contest of
OL,11,     Fthe round-robin stage as a whole,
OL,12,     Fheld at Stade de France. The
OL,13,     FSpringboks have won nine of the
OL,14,     Flast 10 meetings between the
OL,15,     Fsides, with five of those triumphs
OL,16,     Fcoming here, including a 32-17
OL,17,     Fvictory with 14 men when the
OL,18,     Fnations last faced each other 12
OL,19,     Fmonths ago. With analysis from
OL,20,     FBryan Habana, Benjamin Kayser and
OL,21,     FDan Biggar, and commentary by
OL,22,     FMiles Harrison and Ben Kay
